  <processInformation>
    <dataSetInformation>
      <common:UUID>73b510a0-55e9-46bb-b723-6edb0c1e6fd7</common:UUID>
      <name>
        <baseName xml:lang="en">Electricity from natural gas, mix of cogeneration and non-cogeneration, production mix at plant, High Voltage</baseName>
      </name>
      <common:synonyms>Elettricità da gas naturale, mix di cogenerazione e non-cogenerazione, produzione all’impianto, Alto Voltaggio</common:synonyms>
      <classificationInformation>
        <common:classification name="ILCDCategories" classes="../ILCDClassification.xml">
          <common:class level="0">Energy carriers and technologies</common:class>
          <common:class level="1">Electricity</common:class>
        </common:classification>
      </classificationInformation>
      <common:generalComment>Dataset developed according to Arcadia project Methodology (Report: “Metodologia per gli studi di filiera della Banca Dati italiana LCA”). LCA study of electricity production from natural gas in Italy (Report: “Filiera di produzione del mix elettrico italiano”). &#13;
The dataset refers to the production of 1 kWh of electricity from natural gas in high voltage, in Italy, and it is representative of the processing technologies used for this purpose.&#13;
</common:generalComment>
      <referenceToExternalDocumentation type="source data set" refObjectId="43acc110-3539-4317-9a57-6d54f357e1b4" version="01.00.000" uri="../sources/43acc110-3539-4317-9a57-6d54f357e1b4.xml">
        <common:shortDescription>Gabriella Fiorentino, Simona Scalbi, Antonietta Cerbone, Giuliana Ansanelli, Marco Giammartini, Amalia Zucaro. Filiera di produzione del mix elettrico italiano.&#13;
&#13;
Background datasets from EcoInvent database cut-off (v.3.7.1) were used for the LCA study. &#13;
</common:shortDescription>
      </referenceToExternalDocumentation>
    </dataSetInformation>
    <quantitativeReference type="Reference flow(s)">
      <referenceToReferenceFlow>0</referenceToReferenceFlow>
    </quantitativeReference>
    <time>
      <common:referenceYear>2019</common:referenceYear>
      <common:dataSetValidUntil>2026</common:dataSetValidUntil>
      <common:timeRepresentativenessDescription>This dataset has been considered valid until 2026, since no main changes have occurred in the electricity production from natural gas in the investigated years.</common:timeRepresentativenessDescription>
    </time>
    <geography>
      <locationOfOperationSupplyOrProduction location="IT"/>
    </geography>
    <technology>
      <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>The dataset (1kWh of electricity from natural gas in Italy) refers to a system that includes the entire production phase of natural gas, plant engineering, water consumption and emissions (primary data from EMAS declarations of plants representing the Italian reality, and secondary data from TERNA and ISPRA. &#13;
&#13;
For the LCA study, background datasets from EcoInvent database 3.7.1 cut-off were used.&#13;
</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
      <technologicalApplicability>Electricity from Italian electricity mix sold to Italian electric grid.</technologicalApplicability>
    </technology>
  </processInformation>
